    function: "The suit keeps Anakin Skywalker alive after the catastrophic injuries sustained on Mustafar — severe burns over most of his body, severed limbs, and collapsed lungs. It functions as total life support, replacing breathing, regulating body temperature, managing pain, and interfacing with his cybernetic replacements. The suit also incorporates lightsaber-resistant material on the forearm bracers and chest plate. It inhibits some Force abilities — Vader cannot use Force lightning through the suit without electrocuting himself.",
