    loreSignificance: "Stormtrooper armor is the visual language of fascism in Star Wars — white, uniform, featureless, interchangeable. Its evolution from the clone armor of the Republic's loyal troops (itself designed on Jango Fett's Mandalorian template) to the Empire's conscript armor captures the Palpatine ideology in three dimensions: the Republic's protectors became the Empire's instruments. Finn's act of removing his helmet — refusing the facelessness — is the First Order's greatest nightmare actualized.",
